  <div style="flex:1; padding:15px; font-size:16px;">
    <strong>SchoolAI</strong>
    <p style="font-size:14px; margin:6px 0;">An AI learning assistant designed to adapt to each student’s learning style, pace, and interests. It provides on-demand help and guidance, supporting students as they work through concepts while also keeping teachers informed.</p>
